# 源码整体镜像只需要四个服务的源码和依赖清单。
.git
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/data
**/logs
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.md
**/__tests__
**/tests
**/.claude
**/.codebuddy
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# 不参与整体镜像构建的本地部署产物。
deploy/local-source-docker/.admin-key
deploy/local-source-docker/.memory-core-config
deploy/local-source-docker/.proxy-config
deploy/local-source-docker/tdai-local-docker-context

# MemoryCore 的文档、测试和发布辅助目录。
MemoryCore/deploy
MemoryCore/sdk
MemoryCore/docker
MemoryCore/backup-*
MemoryCore/*.pdf
MemoryCore/*.pptx
MemoryCore/*.html
MemoryCore/*.png
MemoryCore/*.tgz

# MemoryProxy 的运行期和测试辅助内容。
MemoryProxy/dashboard
MemoryProxy/gateway
MemoryProxy/e2e
MemoryProxy/scripts/e2e-*
MemoryProxy/scripts/verify-*
MemoryProxy/scripts/warm-*
MemoryProxy/scripts/inspect-*
MemoryProxy/scripts/smoke-*
MemoryProxy/scripts/mock-*
